#: ../../source/design.rst:11
msgid "Packages"
msgstr "Pakete"

#: ../../source/design.rst:13
msgid "All data in PartCAD is bundled into 'packages'."
msgstr "Alle Daten in PartCAD werden in „Paketen“ gebündelt."

#: ../../source/design.rst:15
msgid ""
"Packages are organized in a hierarchical structure where some packages "
"may define \"dependencies\" that become \"child\" packages. The top-level"
" package is called \"//\". If a package called \"//package\" has a "
"dependency called \"sub-package\" then such a sub-package will be called "
"\"//package/sub-package\"."
msgstr ""
"Pakete sind hierarchisch strukturiert, wobei manche Pakete "
"„Abhängigkeiten“ (dependencies) definieren können, die zu „Kind“-Paketen "
"werden. Das oberste Paket heißt „//“. Wenn ein Paket namens „//package“ "
"eine Abhängigkeit namens „sub-package“ hat, dann heißt dieses Unterpaket "
"„//package/sub-package“."

#: ../../source/design.rst:21
msgid ""
"Each package is described using the configuration file ``partcad.yaml`` "
"placed in the package folder."
msgstr ""
"Jedes Paket wird über die Konfigurationsdatei ``partcad.yaml`` im "
"Paketordner beschrieben."

#: ../../source/design.rst:25
msgid "Sketches"
msgstr "Skizzen"

#: ../../source/design.rst:27
msgid ""
"PartCAD uses 2D sketches to create 3D models (e.g. via `extrude` or "
"`sweep`) and to maintain various metadata (such as the geometry of "
"interfaces between parts, arbitrary part metadata like camera view angles"
" and so on)."
msgstr ""
"PartCAD verwendet 2D-Skizzen, um 3D-Modelle zu erstellen (z. B. über "
"`extrude` oder `sweep`) und um verschiedene Metadaten zu pflegen (etwa "
"die Geometrie von Interfaces zwischen Teilen, beliebige Teil-Metadaten "
"wie Kamerablickwinkel und so weiter)."

#: ../../source/design.rst:31
msgid "Basic shapes"
msgstr "Grundformen"

#: ../../source/design.rst:33
msgid "Outer shape: `circle`, `rectangle`, `square`"
msgstr "Äußere Form: `circle`, `rectangle`, `square`"

#: ../../source/design.rst:34
msgid "Optional inner shape: `circle`, `rectangle`, `square`"
msgstr "Optionale innere Form: `circle`, `rectangle`, `square`"

